# madcide keybinding profile: JOE/WordStar-style — the default, the
# owner's full basic editing set. One binding per line: key sequence,
# spaces, action name (the LAST word). Sequences are space-separated key
# spellings, any length; letters are case-insensitive (^K S == ^K s).
# Lines starting with # and blank lines are ignored.
#
# File and exit
^k x savequit
^k d save
^k s save
^k r insertfile
^c discard
^k h help
^t options
^k z shell
# Movement (the WordStar diamond; these delegate to the one shared
# movement implementation — the action name is the key vocabulary)
^b left
^f right
^p up
^n down
^a home
^e end
^z wordleft
^x wordright
^u pgup
^v pgdn
^k u top
^k v bottom
^k l gotoline
# Editing
^d del
^y delline
^w delword
^_ undo
^^ redo
# Blocks
^k b mark
^k k bend
^k c blockcopy
^k m blockmove
^k y blockdel
# Search
^k f find
^l findnext
# madcide
^k q quit
^k e check
^k o outline
^k p profile
^k n view
^k t theme
